        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-PAGETURNER-RASTERIZER-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-RASTERIZER-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-FRAME-WIDTH              PIC 9(04) VALUE 0320.
            05  WS-FRAME-HEIGHT             PIC 9(04) VALUE 0240.
            05  WS-Z-BUFFER-DEPTH-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-DAT-BIN-COMPLIANT        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-RASTERIZER-PROOF-CODE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-RASTERIZER-PIPELINE.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-RASTERIZER-PIPELINE.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-FRAME-WIDTH = 0320 AND
               WS-FRAME-HEIGHT = 0240 AND
               WS-Z-BUFFER-DEPTH-OK = 1 AND
               WS-DAT-BIN-COMPLIANT = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-RASTERIZER-PROOF-CODE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-RASTERIZER-PROOF-CODE.
